      "content": "i don't even know what i'm doing here. everything i thought was true, everything i built my life around... it just dissolved. it feels like the floor literally isn't there anymore. just this massive, empty space where my purpose used to be. how is anyone supposed to just keep existing when the foundation is gone? it feels totally pointless.",
